#: contents/ui/settings/PaymentMethodEdit.qml:155
msgid ""
"The CVC (Card Verification Code) is the 3-digit number located on the back "
"of your card, usually at the top of the signature strip. By including it "
"with your order, you help protect your account from fraud and you give us "
"one more way of being sure your order is legitimate."
msgstr ""
"VKK(Verifikacijski Kod Kartice) je trocifreni broj koji se nalazi na "
"poleđini vaše kartice, obično na vrhu trake s potpisom. Uključivanjem tog "
"broja uz narudžbu pomažete u zaštiti vašeg računa od prevare te nam dajete "
"još jedan način da budemo sigurni da je narudžba legitimna."

